&lt;p&gt;In 2008 font retailer &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20130921143718/http:/typophile.com/wiki/FontShop"&gt;FontShop&lt;/a&gt; released FontStruct, a free, online tool for the design, publishing and sharing of user created fonts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The tool is limited to modular fonts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20130921143718/http:/www.fontstruct.com/" title="http://www.fontstruct.com"&gt;http://www.fontstruct.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See also: &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20130921143718/http:/typophile.com/wiki/tools"&gt;tools&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>